grilles, diffusers, electrical and access panels, and piping and conduit adjacent to wall surfaces unless otherwise 
specified.  Paint items not specified in other paragraphs to match adjacent wall surface.  Provide wall materials 
to match the colors listed below.</TXT><BRK/>
